{"title":"세븐틴","artist":"YOASOBI","sourceId":"reference:CuunYD9PRO9gmgfyBMWZ","sourceHash":"95be1670c5ee5e2b89bfbc5dd965f45d6cd50761aa123544cbfd9eef9c97f6f3","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":35871602,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":27.54,"end":29.25,"text":"鏡写しかのような","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":29.25,"end":30.92,"text":"瓜二つの世界に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":30.92,"end":33.97,"text":"それぞれ生まれた二人の私","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":33.97,"end":36.09,"text":"在るべき場所が違ったか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":36.09,"end":37.78,"text":"神様が間違ったか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":37.78,"end":42.92,"text":"同じ姿形中身は真反対","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":42.92,"end":48.14,"text":"♪","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":48.14,"end":49.74,"text":"違和感はどうやら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":49.74,"end":51.44,"text":"ずっと前に育ってた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":51.44,"end":54.58,"text":"パパもママも大事に思ってる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":54.58,"end":56.62,"text":"だけど私はどうやら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":56.62,"end":58.32,"text":"此処じゃ私じゃないから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":58.32,"end":61.61,"text":"赤は赤に黒は黒に戻るの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":61.61,"end":65.28,"text":"次元を隔てた向こう側の世界じゃ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":65.28,"end":68.95,"text":"今日だって残酷な悪魔が鳴いている","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":68.95,"end":72.15,"text":"あっちの私は怖がりで泣き虫なの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":72.15,"end":76.89,"text":"見て見ぬ振りできないから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":76.89,"end":77.51,"text":"これじゃ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":77.51,"end":80.28999999999999,"text":"ハッピーエンドとはいかない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":80.28999999999999,"end":83.67,"text":"それじゃ救いに行くね世界","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":83.67,"end":87.53,"text":"こんな乱暴な私を許して","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":87.53,"end":90.62,"text":"きっとやり遂げるから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":90.62,"end":93.99000000000001,"text":"これはバッドエンドなんかじゃない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":93.99000000000001,"end":97.35,"text":"どこに居たとしても私は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":97.35,"end":101.67,"text":"そう世界で一人のオリジナル","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":101.67,"end":108.21000000000001,"text":"誇らしく思ってくれたら嬉しいな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":108.21000000000001,"end":112.97999999999999,"text":"♪","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":112.97999999999999,"end":115.19,"text":"境界の線で切り分けた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":115.19,"end":117.03,"text":"こちら側の世界じゃ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":117.03,"end":120.48,"text":"今日だって呑気な天使があくびする","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":120.48,"end":122.22,"text":"気付いてしまった悪は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":122.22,"end":123.85,"text":"見逃せないから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":123.85,"end":128.59,"text":"帰り道を交換しよう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":128.59,"end":131.61,"text":"私が希望になるの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":131.61,"end":135.42,"text":"お別れは少し寂しいけれど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":135.42,"end":139.06,"text":"いつか目尻に作った傷も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":139.06,"end":145.74,"text":"理不尽に立ち向かった証だから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":145.74,"end":149.12,"text":"いつかハッピーエンドになるまで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":149.12,"end":152.54,"text":"世界を相手に戦うの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":152.54,"end":156.21,"text":"こんな乱暴な私をずっと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":156.21,"end":159.48,"text":"愛してくれてありがとう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":159.48,"end":162.85,"text":"これはバッドエンドなんかじゃない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":162.85,"end":166.3,"text":"どこに居たとしても私は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":166.3,"end":170.57999999999998,"text":"あなたの唯一無二のオリジナル","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":170.57999999999998,"end":173.34,"text":"誇らしく生きるよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":173.34,"end":176.14,"text":"さあ在るべき場所に帰ろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":176.14,"end":181.37,"text":"さよならを告げたセブンティーン","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":181.37,"end":199.0,"text":"♪","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}